}

/*
    2 types of loops for now

    ```
    // c style
    for int i = 0; i < 10; 1{}

    // while style
    for i < 10{}
    ```

    will have iterator loops too!
    ```
    for i in arr{}
    ```
*/
f cmp(){
    for i = 0; i < 10; -1{
        i+=1
        // just a small loop
    }
}

/* 
Expression types:
    1           - Literal
    1+1         - Arithmetic
    1<2         - Comparison
    (1+1) + 1   - Arithmetic + Subexpression
    (1+1) >= 2  - Arithmetic + Comparison
    1+1+1       - MTOO Arithmetic
         (More Than One Operator)
*/